                "ImageDescription": {
                  "value": "Baigana-bilati poda is char-cooked/barbequed eggplant and tomato mixed with a generous portion of minced garlic, onion, chili pepper, and cilantro, and garnished with mustard oil. The dish is a native of Odisha, India and is popular in eastern India. It is often paired as a side dish with <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakhala\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Pakhala\">Pakhala</a> and rice.",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
